  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "積體電路後段製程技術",
    "sub_ename": "BACK-END PROCESS TECHNOLOGY OF INTEGRATED CIRCUIT",
    "describe_ch": "此課程主要針對後段製程做詳細的說明，包括電漿物理、蝕刻技術、顯影技術、平坦化技術、金屬薄膜技術等。在整合製程部分，也將整個 CMOS 製程流程詳細介紹，讓學生有整體的概念。 \n",
    "describe_eh": "This course focuses mainly on back-end process. It will provide detailed description. It includes plasma physics, etching technology, photolithography technology, CMP technology and metallization. In integration process, the whole CMOS process will be introduced, such that the learner has the whole concepts. \n",
